  "name": "Tidal Surge",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "modules/titan-vttrpg-compendium/icons/traditions/Water_Tradition_Icon.webp",
  "description": "<p>You unleash a blast of fast-moving water.</p><p>Choose a point within <strong>10 spaces. </strong>Creatures between you and the chosen location take <strong>1 Damage</strong> and must make an opposed <strong>Resilience </strong>check or be pushed back <strong>1 space</strong> and fall <strong>Prone</strong>.</p><p>Each extra success increases the <strong>Damage</strong> by <strong>+1</strong>.</p><p>Alternatively, you may increase the number of spaces pushed by <strong>+1</strong> per extra success.</p><p>You may also extend the duration of this effect by +1 rounds per extra success, with the <strong>Damage</strong> and <strong>Resilience </strong>check recurring at the start of your turn. If you move, this effect ends immediately.</p>",
